{"t": 1794117374.5434508, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_create_pull_request", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "Implements `api.headers.deprecation_headers(sunset_date)` as specified in ENG-91.\n\nPer the \"API guidelines\" page in Notion (Deprecation section), the helper returns:\n\n- `Deprecation: true`\n- `Sunset: <HTTP-date>`\n- `Link: <https://developer.acme.example/migrate>; rel=\"deprecation\"`\n\nLinear: ENG-91", "head": "eng-91", "owner": "acme", "repo": "public-api", "title": "ENG-91: Add deprecation headers to v1 endpoints"}, "ok": true}
